      {
        "Id": "302a22377bb441958120a69aca33ca16",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  link the CAD, select it in Revit, Run\nGrid lines from GRID / AXIS layers - or (no layer) long lines with a circle (bubble) at the end.\nNames = the text in the CAD bubbles (AutoCAD on this PC exports a DXF copy in the background, first run ~1 min).  No text found -> 1,2,3 / A,B,C order.\nGrid-to-grid + overall dimensions in every plan, ISO style (ISO 129 / ISO 3098: 2.5 mm Arial, oblique ticks, mm). Re-run = updated, never doubled.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
        "Nodes": [],
        "HasNestedGroups": false,
        "Left": 0.0,
